At the time Lojban was baselined, there were some who were loudly in favour of there being an official Language Academy instituted to do the sort of stuff a Language Academy does. This idea was explicitly quashed by Lojban Central at the time. Jboske is not an officially-appointed or self-appointed Language Academy.

* The baupla fuzykamni which the Board is currently finalising discussion on (more info when it does finalise it) is closer to an Academy --- although, as a commission, its mandate is circumscribed. It is not a jboskeist body, although it will clearly need to consult with jboskeists. -- nitcion
